<section class="rm-head"><div><p class="rm-eyebrow">Settings · Privacy</p><h1>Personal data access</h1><p class="rm-lede">Recent authenticated access to this inventory. Entries identify the account or membership, category and time without copying customer content or private links.</p><a href="/settings/privacy">Customer privacy requests</a></div></section>
<section class="card section"><div class="card-head"><h2>Review access</h2></div><div class="card-body"><p>Entries are retained for <%= access.retentionDays %> days. The list below shows the latest 100. An entry records authorized access or an attempted app request; it does not prove a page finished loading. Private-link access identifies the link’s business record, rather than a named recipient.</p>
<p>Platform support inspections have a separate audit and require a customer-approved, expiring grant. Background processing retains job and effect evidence.</p>
<% if(access.lastReviewedAt){ %><p>Last review recorded <%= helpers.dateTime(access.lastReviewedAt) %>.</p><% } %>
<p>Review unfamiliar accounts, unexpected exports and private links. <a href="mailto:support@stockchiefhq.com">Report a concern</a> promptly; do not include passwords or tokens. <a href="/security/data-protection">Data protection policy</a></p>
<form method="post" action="/settings/privacy/access-review"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><p><label><input type="checkbox" name="reviewed" value="yes" required> I reviewed access and reported any concern.</label></p><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Record review</button></form></div></section>
<section class="card section"><div class="card-head"><h2>Recent access</h2></div><div class="card-body"><div style="overflow-x:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Account or membership</th><th>Channel</th><th>Category</th><th>Operation</th></tr></thead><tbody><% access.rows.forEach(function(row){ %><tr><td><%= helpers.dateTime(row.created_at) %></td><td><%= row.account_id||row.actor_id||'Private business link' %></td><td><%= row.channel %></td><td><%= row.area %></td><td><%= row.method %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></div></section>
